WEBVTT

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.730
Hey, Sou.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:10.610
If Yui successfully prevents Kaori's accident,

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.650
what do you suppose will happen to her then?

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:13.860
The same as if she fails.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.950
To prevent her from
impacting events any further,

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.040
she'll simply enter into sleep mode.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:23.920
Sou, it's actually dawned on you, hasn't it?

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.960
That in a future where
Kaori's accident didn't happen,

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.380
there will no longer
be a need to create Yui.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.130
Yeah.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:30.840
Then...

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.840
Will Yui continue to exist in this future?

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:39.100
Will entering sleep mode
be all that happens to her?

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.180
In reality, won't Yui...

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.020
What do you mean?

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:52.360
Let me go.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.490
S-Sorry.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.120
I am going home.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:11.920
Sou...

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.760
Sou-kun, where's Yui-chan?

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:16.180
She went home.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:17.220
What?

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.640
Kaori, did something happen?

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.060
She said something about how she'd be going away soon.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:27.810
What's that supposed to mean?

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.440
Did she remember something?

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.230
I don't know, but...

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.820
Why did she look at me like that?

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:41.990
Sou...

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.580
It doesn't matter who I fall in love with, does it?

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.420
Here's the thing, Yui-chan...

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:53.590
I-It's about Sou-kun. Do you...

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.220
...love him...

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.230
Morning!

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.820
Airi-chan...

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.110
So you're alone today?

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.990
Yeah, kind of.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.160
That thing from yesterday?

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.200
Yesterday was a surprise.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.870
I've never seen Sou-kun look like that.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.540
So, you know, Noda-sensei,
the science teacher,

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.750
gets the time for his classes
mixed up and stuff all the time.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.420
He does?

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.920
You seem kind of subdued.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.680
I would not say...

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:07.720
It is coming up soon, isn't it?

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:11.230
Hey, if you're up for it, come see my performance, Furukawa-san.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.810
Yes, I would like to see it very much.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.230
I'll totally go all-out!

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:18.980
Sure.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:22.320
You know, my cousin's coming
to the school festival.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.780
She's still in middle school,
but she's just adorable.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:26.120
And it seems like—

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.030
Yui.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.870
Akiyama-san.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.950
Uh, I'll go on ahead.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:32.960
Okay.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.800
Sorry about yesterday.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.010
Not at all.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.010
I want to talk to you properly.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.260
Yui, I...

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.600
Please stop this!

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:51.270
There is nothing I wish to talk to you about!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.440
Sorry.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.000
So, today's cafeteria day, huh?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.790
Oh, it's you, Airi.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.170
What's up with you today?

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.760
You're a droopy mess.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.470
We're going to see the stars today, aren't we?

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.720
Oh, that's right.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.640
Sorry.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.430
Let me take a rain check.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.720
I'm not in the mood today.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:33.850
Huh?

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.850
What the heck's going on? Sheesh.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:40.520
Do you suppose she's up on the roof
right now or something?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:44.900
Why is it Yui?

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.950
Huh? What?

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.820
Sorry, what did you say?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.740
I said you're a jerk!

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:52.620
Ow!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.380
What am I doing?

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.800
When there's nowhere at all for me to go...

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:20.860
Looking for someone?

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:24.110
Nagisa-senpai! What are you doing?

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.940
I was having my lunch.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.450
Something wrong with that?

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:29.820
Uh, no, not really.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:31.820
If it's Yui-san you're after, she's not here.

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:33.620
I see.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:41.330
It's rare to see you so concerned
about someone else.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.630
Well, maybe I'm being overly self-conscious,

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:49.550
but I feel like Yui sometimes looks at me
like she wants to say something.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.760
That kind of bothered me,

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.970
and it was like, I couldn't ignore it...

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:58.310
And her passing out naked on the fifth floor
makes no sense either.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.600
There are all these questions, and...

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:03.150
it's like, something about her
is different from the other girls.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.900
Do you think she's remembered something?

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.990
She seems lost in thought all the time.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.530
I wonder if you find yourself
drawn to enigmatic things.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.040
N-No, it's not like that. I mean, she's...

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.460
I have no idea what you plan to do,
but for her sake,

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:24.170
don't run away from a certain someone's feelings
or try to sweep them under the rug.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.380
If you do anything like that,

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.050
you should know that I won't forgive you.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:37.520
Oh!

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.100
Oh, the girl from before.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:43.400
Um, Furukawa-san didn't come back after that...

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.940
Would you happen to know anything?

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:46.070
What?

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.620
Next, we have "Chunagon mairi-tamaite."

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.920
First of all, "mairi," as in "mairu," is deferential language,

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.250
so "the Chunagon approached,"
which equals...

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:12.720
<i>Pay attention now.</i>

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:17.050
October 14th. At 16:20.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.600
This is the place.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:23.440
Save Sasaki Kaori from the
bus accident that happens here.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:30.780
Sou, this is still too much for Yui
to understand right now.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:33.900
If I save Sasaki Kaori,

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.950
Sou and Airi will be happy.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:37.830
Is that right?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.410
Yeah, that's right.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:45.330
There's something I have to say to her.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:53.630
<i>Kaori-san always confesses
her feelings to Sou, in every timeline.</i>

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:57.510
<i>And yet, not once has Sou
given her a clear answer.</i>

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.640
<i>That is why he made me.</i>

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:03.730
<i>If these "chains of fate"
are related not to the accident</i>

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:08.440
<i>but to Sou's feelings for Kaori-san...</i>

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.570
Excuse me.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:18.490
Would you happen to have seen a girl with long hair
wearing a school uniform?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.870
In either case, if I succeed in saving Kaori-san,

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.080
I myself will...

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:32.510
Yui!

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.430
H-Hey...

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.600
Wait up.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.310
I'm sorry.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:46.350
I was wrong.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.310
I won't ask you anything anymore.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.360
Let's go back to school.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:51.940
No.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.190
No?

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.320
I don't want to go back.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:59.320
You can't exactly stay here forever, right?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:11.710
So, then...

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:15.170
This is my first time being in this area.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.090
Oh, right. It still hasn't been that long for you, has it?

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.600
I've always lived in Uchihama and to me,
it's the same old same old, but...

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.100
<i>The town where Sou grew up...</i>

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.520
<i>Time Sou has spent that I know nothing about.</i>

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.520
I would like to walk around town.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.360
This is the Uchihama Shopping Arcade.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.860
They have cheaper and better goods than any supermarket out there.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.490
That's something both Kaori and I agree on.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:46.290
You cook at home as well,
do you not, Akiyama-san?

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.210
We're on a roster system, so to speak.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:51.210
I would have liked to have had a taste.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:01.090
This is the kindergarten Kaori and I went to.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.600
It was a bit shabbier back then, but...

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.140
You as a kindergartener?

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.930
I cannot imagine it.

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:10.020
Oh man, talk about adorable!

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.650
The star of the kindergarten!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:13.690
Kaori was, that is.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:18.400
You have known Kaori-san
since around that time, correct?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.280
She used to be way more
of a crybaby back then.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:21.950
<i>Sou and Kaori-san have spent all this time growing up together.</i>

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:25.200
But for all that,
she wasn't shy around strangers.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:25.620
That reminds me, she tried to join a field trip that the elementary school next door was going on, you know.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.580
<i>But I...</i>

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.200
That reminds me, she tried to join a field trip that the elementary school next door was going on, you know.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.330
<i>Being with Sou like this, just the two of us...</i>

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:31.040
We were going on a field trip at that time too,
but during roll-call on the bus,

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.210
<i>Here I am, wishing this time could last forever.</i>

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:37.710
the teacher in charge noticed and it blew out into this huge incident...

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:38.760
What's wrong?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.720
Thank you very much.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.760
I will go home now.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.100
Hang out with me for just a little longer.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.520
Yeah. Yeah.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.770
Thanks for taking care of it.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.520
Let Nagisa-senpai know too.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.270
Bye.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:04.280
This is where you can get the clearest view
of the stars in Uchihama.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.910
We were really supposed to come here
with everyone today...

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.830
That's true.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:12.040
The plan went a little awry,

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.420
but it's not like they're interested
in the stars anyway.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:22.300
The Square of Pegasus.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:26.550
Scheat. Alpheratz. Algenib. Markab.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:30.430
And the brightest star
far below them is Fomalhaut.

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.770
You like stars?

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.940
I was taught all about them.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.820
Like this, looking at the stars together
on many occasions.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.070
Huh...

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:43.320
Oh!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:48.330
May I get to spend tomorrow, the day after,
and all eternity just idling along and having fun.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.370
<i>The future that Sou desires...</i>

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.620
<i>The only person who can make Sou's smile
last into the future...</i>

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.830
<i>is me.</i>

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:04.590
It would be great if that shooting star would grant your wish someday.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.430
Well, it might. You never know.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.760
That is so like you, Akiyama-san.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.020
Look, another one.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:15.390
<i>If this is something that can be granted, Sou...</i>

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:20.110
<i>don't forget about me.</i>

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.900
Did you make a wish too, Yui?

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.400
Akiyama-san, there is a favor
I would like to ask of you.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.160
Huh? Of me?

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.870
Tomorrow, after school,

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.830
please make sure to bring
Kaori-san to the club room.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.370
Huh? What's this all of a sudden?

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.750
One other thing.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.590
Kaori-san should reveal her heart
to you tomorrow.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:40.040
What?

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.710
When she does, please give her
an answer, without fail.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.760
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:47.260
What is this? Why are you
suddenly saying this stuff?

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.010
Please.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:01.320
Your boxed lunch looked
really tasty today, Kaori.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.070
So? Did something happen
between you and Yui-chan?

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.900
Tomorrow, I'll pack one for you too, Airi-chan.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:04.320
What? Really?
So? Did something happen
between you and Yui-chan?

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.320
What's going on?
What? Really?

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:05.940
What's going on?

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.700
What <i>is</i> going on, I wonder.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.570
You know, Sou,

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:13.200
they say there's a time
...when a guy must decide...

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.540
Kaori-san, I need to speak
with you for a moment.

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:26.880
I've been thinking that I needed
to talk to you, too.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:30.890
I am sorry for suddenly running out
of the house the day before yesterday.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.010
Oh, no, I'm the one who should apologize.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:35.470
I shouldn't have said what I did.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:42.230
I hold no special feelings for Akiyama-san.

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:44.440
Really?

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:45.360
Yes.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:54.580
You know, we only met a little while ago,
and I don't quite know how to say this,

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.750
but I feel like there's a part of you
that's a lot like me.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.830
So I get the sense that you might be lying.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.500
I can just kind of tell.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.130
That is not...

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:06.590
Really?

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:15.100
I'm planning to tell Sou-kun how I feel.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:21.190
That might mean that I'll get hurt,
or that I'll hurt somebody else, but in the end,

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.480
I can't move forward
if things stay the way they are.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.730
Are you okay with that, Yui-chan?

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.120
Bye-bye, Furukawa-san.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.410
See you tomorrow.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.500
Bye-bye.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.170
Hey, over here!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:06.150
Ooh! What about this?

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.820
Oh, that looks good.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:08.980
Mm.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:12.950
Well then, I would like each of you
to continue on with your wholesome academy lives.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.090
Sou-kun.

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.430
I want to tell you that I...

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.140
I love you, Sou-kun.

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:47.020
Not as family or like siblings,

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:49.900
but a different kind of love.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:51.990
I...

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:55.990
Huh?

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.740
What's up, Yui?

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:00.540
I am just...

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.750
If something's up, tell me, okay?

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.750
I <i>am</i> technically the club president, after all.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.460
It is okay.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:08.630
Airi.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:13.880
Goodbye.

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:15.930
Oh, Yui!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:28.900
Airi.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:32.690
Sou, you know, about Yui...

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:35.570
I was just about to go look for her.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:39.280
She left earlier, saying she was going shopping for supplies.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.830
Shopping for supplies? What supplies?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:44.410
She was acting kind of weird, you know?

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.290
She said, "Goodbye," and stuff...

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.460
Take care of Kaori for a bit, okay?

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:49.250
Huh?!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:57.090
<i>If Sou's regret at having been unable to respond to the romantic confession is part of this fate...</i>

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.970
<i>If Sou responds to Kaori-san's feelings,</i>

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.310
<i>it just might be that...</i>

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.960
What are you doing here?

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.040
You know...

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.140
Was there an accident?

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:44.890
What?

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.280
Sou...

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.400
Sou?

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:57.610
Sou!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:58.280
Yeah, I'm okay.
Sou!

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:01.320
Yeah, I'm okay.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:02.490
What about you?

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.580
Sou...

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:05.240
Are you hurt?

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.750
I am... fine.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.630
Never mind me. You...

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:12.750
I'm all right.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:13.880
It's no big deal.

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:14.630
Owowow...

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:17.300
Don't make me worry like that.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.090
Just how much are you gonna
make me chase you?

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.010
I am sorry.

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:24.600
I'd better call the police for—

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:25.390
Sou.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:28.680
What about Kaori-san?
Did you give her your answer?

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:30.520
I did.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:34.310
I told Kaori that I love you.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:35.520
What?

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:41.110
Why?

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:45.830
Lately, all I've done is think about you.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:49.290
I think about how I don't want you to look sad.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.000
I think about how I want you here with me.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.420
I want to know more about you.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:55.710
Sou...

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.550
I can't lie to myself.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.140
<i>I'm fading...</i>

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:07.350
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.180
<i>It's over.</i>

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:13.350
Hey, what's wrong?

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.020
You <i>are</i> in pain, right?

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:16.110
Sou...

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:17.940
Y-Yui?

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:22.450
I... I finally got your future...

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.700
Yui, I...

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:31.370
I love you, Yui.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:35.710
As do I. I love you.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.510
Sou...

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.890
Goodbye.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:05.740
Sou-kun?!

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:06.410
What?

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.830
What happened?

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:13.790
Oh, uh, I kind of got mixed up in some stuff.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.290
It's nothing serious, though. Honestly.

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:20.880
Sheesh! You really are absentminded, Sou-kun.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:22.840
Don't make me worry, okay?

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.340
You be careful too, Kaori.

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:26.890
You're clumsier than me, after all.

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:35.020
Sou-san, you were here alone, right?

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:36.940
What? Yeah.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:40.230
Huh? This is... all of us, right?

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:41.230
Eh?

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:44.070
What is this...

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:27.550
About yesterday... Do you remember?

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:29.630
Didn't we have a conversation like this before too?

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:30.130
Must be déjà vu.

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:30.680
What is that girl to you?
Must be déjà vu.

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:31.720
What is that girl to you?

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:32.340
Sou...

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:34.140
I'm sure I'd want to see her again.

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:36.350
Getting to see you again tomorrow is enough.

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:40.440
Final episode: "The Future That Has You."
